  "body": "After the move of this repo into WHATWG I manually put the contents of the gh-pages branch on https://bluetooth.spec.whatwg.org/ so that the spec is still reachable.\n\nIn order to get it into WHATWG style and automatically deploying, https://github.com/whatwg/spec-factory needs to be run. The script is going to fail because there's more than one *.bs file in this repo, so either they need to be moved or the script needs updating to not assume a single file.",
